cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use JETCARP in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "JETCARP: Jimmie's Euclidean Tilings and Cellular Automata Research Program"
abstract: >-
  JETCARP runs cellular automata on square, hexagonal, Archimedean, k-uniform,
  isohedral, custom periodic and aperiodic tilings (Penrose, hat and spectre),
  with several automata at once on shared or separate cell fields. It includes
  a graphical app, a command line, a scripting language, and a Model Context
  Protocol server, plus search tools for spaceships, oscillators and other
  patterns, verified pattern catalogues, and reproducible scenes identified by
  state hashes.
